---
description: Keep all skills created for this project inside the repository.
alwaysApply: true
---

- Create and update skills only in this repository's `.cursor/skills/` directory.
- Never install or create skills in the user's personal folders, including `~/.codex/skills`, `~/.agents/skills`, or `~/.cursor/skills`.
- When asked to bump the version, use `.cursor/skills/bump-version/SKILL.md`.
